=== nil to interface variable
result = nil

=== interface common field accessor
return e.pos

=== IsType narrows for field access
if it.is_a?(Book)
    return it.title

=== type switch binding shadows type name
if operand.is_a?(VInt)

=== empty map in return statement
return {}

=== match case binding shadows type in body
if v.is_a?(VInt)
    v_int = v

=== map literal with interface value in return
return {"a" => Leaf.new(v: 1)}

=== list literal with interface type in return
return [Leaf.new(v: 1)]
